{"3718760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galactic Brawl", "steam_appid": 3718760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends (or make new rivals) and jump into <strong>Galactic Brawl</strong>, a fast-paced multiplayer party brawler packed with wacky battles and absurd weaponry. With up to <strong>8 players</strong> per match, every showdown becomes an unforgettable free-for-all of chaos, comedy, and competitive mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e481dd7f02f42faba59ac0ce7220b144.poster.avif?t=1770995723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e481dd7f02f42faba59ac0ce7220b144.webm?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e481dd7f02f42faba59ac0ce7220b144.mp4?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whimsical Weaponry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn every fight into a spectacle with ridiculous weapons that keep matches unpredictable and hilarious:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roast rivals with a <strong>BBQ flamethrower</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap enemies silly with a <strong>giant slippery fish</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zap opponents using an <strong>electric fly swatter</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash foes with a <strong>rock-and-roll guitar</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire bowling balls from a <strong>slingshot</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel enemies in with a <strong>sticky frog tongue</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon adds a new layer of strategy—and nonsense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e55ce4a7ccfba1cccfbbd244ee49500f.poster.avif?t=1770995723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e55ce4a7ccfba1cccfbbd244ee49500f.webm?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e55ce4a7ccfba1cccfbbd244ee49500f.mp4?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mascot Madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a vibrant roster of quirky mascots, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xurono</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sirius</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artemis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your favorite characters with fun outfits and bring their unique style into the brawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/c9773bd7be7f05db626c1e5841696d77.poster.avif?t=1770995723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/c9773bd7be7f05db626c1e5841696d77.webm?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/c9773bd7be7f05db626c1e5841696d77.mp4?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Frenzied Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Galactic Brawl</strong> isn’t just about fighting. Dive into a rotating lineup of <strong>mini-games</strong> that challenge your reflexes, tactics, and creativity. Dodge hazards, outmaneuver opponents, and use wild weapons in unexpected ways—perfect for couch chaos or online play.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite friends (or make new rivals) and jump into <strong>Galactic Brawl</strong>, a fast-paced multiplayer party brawler packed with wacky battles and absurd weaponry. With up to <strong>8 players</strong> per match, every showdown becomes an unforgettable free-for-all of chaos, comedy, and competitive mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e481dd7f02f42faba59ac0ce7220b144.poster.avif?t=1770995723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e481dd7f02f42faba59ac0ce7220b144.webm?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e481dd7f02f42faba59ac0ce7220b144.mp4?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whimsical Weaponry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn every fight into a spectacle with ridiculous weapons that keep matches unpredictable and hilarious:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roast rivals with a <strong>BBQ flamethrower</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slap enemies silly with a <strong>giant slippery fish</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zap opponents using an <strong>electric fly swatter</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash foes with a <strong>rock-and-roll guitar</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire bowling balls from a <strong>slingshot</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reel enemies in with a <strong>sticky frog tongue</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each weapon adds a new layer of strategy—and nonsense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e55ce4a7ccfba1cccfbbd244ee49500f.poster.avif?t=1770995723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e55ce4a7ccfba1cccfbbd244ee49500f.webm?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/e55ce4a7ccfba1cccfbbd244ee49500f.mp4?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mascot Madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a vibrant roster of quirky mascots, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Xurono</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sirius</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artemis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your favorite characters with fun outfits and bring their unique style into the brawl.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/c9773bd7be7f05db626c1e5841696d77.poster.avif?t=1770995723\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/c9773bd7be7f05db626c1e5841696d77.webm?t=1770995723\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3718760/extras/c9773bd7be7f05db626c1e5841696d77.mp4?t=17709957